/**
 * LIVE — flagship "Combined" game-landing design, Wave 11 (2026-09-24).
 *
 * DayZ was blocked since Wave 4 on a real gap — its dedicated-server depot
 * rejects anonymous SteamCMD login — solved via lib/dayz-steam.ts (a
 * dedicated Nxeon-owned Steam account) and lib/game-config.ts's DAYZ schema
 * (serverDZ.cfg's file-based config, applied through worker/game-config.ts's
 * applyDayZ). See prisma/seed-wave11-dayz.ts for the full mechanism and the
 * one manual step still open (that Steam account doesn't exist yet, so
 * lib/game-order.ts refuses real orders until it does).
 *
 * PREVIEW_GAMES.dayz was authored directly from the real seeded GamePlan
 * rows (prisma/seed-wave11-dayz.ts — 6GB/20-player $14.99, 8GB/40-player
 * $22.99 popular, 12GB/60-player $32.99), so no price override is needed
 * here.
 */

